--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. CORE IS COMPLETE WITHOUT THIS SUBTREE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`rm -rf ee/` leaves a fully functional, fully tested, Apache-2.0-licensed
product. This is enforced mechanically: continuous integration deletes `ee/`
and runs the complete Core test suite on every commit. Core does not import
from `ee/`, and never will.

You are under no obligation to use, build, or retain this subtree.

